This directory contains files that must exist on a web server,
for some of the tests to run.
We can't test xhr, for example, without the internet.
I tried using xhr to fetch local files, but chrome does not permit it,
due to cross-origin considerations.
For now these files are hosted on edbrowse.org,
and the various urls point to edbrowse.org.
jsfrm.html is used by jsrt, but only if you expand the frame.

The files in acid3 are required by the acid3 test,
and are hosted on acid3.acidtests.org.
